{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09466","headline":"鸢夺巢 · 韦应物","name":"鸢夺巢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野鹊野鹊巢林梢，鸱鸢恃力夺鹊巢。\n吞鹊之肝啄鹊脑，窃食偷居还自保。\n凤凰五色百鸟尊，知鸢爲害何不言？\n霜鸇野鹞得残肉，同啄羶腥不肯逐。\n可怜百鸟纷纵横，虽有深林何处宿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09466.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09466","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}